        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a04f57a6-30d4-3213-bc84-2718dbc0a106",
                "word": "навскидку",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "122aa084-353e-38e8-aebc-711a95d9305c",
                        "entry_id": "a04f57a6-30d4-3213-bc84-2718dbc0a106",
                        "glosses": [
                            "охотн., воен. быстро вскидывая ружьё и ни на что не опираясь локтями"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "(о стрельбе)"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0db600fe-e962-43ef-94a3-f0902bab9008",
                                "sense_id": "122aa084-353e-38e8-aebc-711a95d9305c",
                                "text": "Я, целясь навскидку, попал в дерево: из ствола торчал хвостик колючей, расщепленной от близкого выстрела мельхиоровой пульки."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "50751479-5c34-4d19-a0ba-6242a203d31f",
                                "sense_id": "122aa084-353e-38e8-aebc-711a95d9305c",
                                "text": "…с автоматами навскидку они выскочили из кустов метрах в семидесяти от меня."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efc7009e-1329-43a7-8a6f-36fa1f846536",
                                "sense_id": "122aa084-353e-38e8-aebc-711a95d9305c",
                                "text": "Однако не просто потому, что Арбузов, почти не целясь, навскидку расписался на церковной стене из маузера, а потому, что никто не мог предсказать, когда и по какому поводу этот маузер окажется в его руке."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d439abe-208c-4927-8af6-583dc1015c30",
                                "sense_id": "122aa084-353e-38e8-aebc-711a95d9305c",
                                "text": "Меня и Алешу задержали на курсах, мы подменили посланных на задание инструкторов, новый набор едва уместился в коровнике, я учил парней и девушек бегать на лыжах, развинчивать немецкие мины, стрелять навскидку."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d025dcd-ad0b-3276-bfe2-471f3e27d6a7",
                        "entry_id": "a04f57a6-30d4-3213-bc84-2718dbc0a106",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. без подготовки; оценочно; быстро, но неточно, наудачу"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d73afeb-e816-4122-b78b-9c2920885555",
                                "sense_id": "7d025dcd-ad0b-3276-bfe2-471f3e27d6a7",
                                "text": "Ирина достаточно образованна, чтобы навскидку определить примерную дату рождения мебели."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8031ceb9-4a3f-4793-8eab-41b60d0c8ba6",
                                "sense_id": "7d025dcd-ad0b-3276-bfe2-471f3e27d6a7",
                                "text": "Сплести сеточку — нехитрое дело… Самых простых способов Оленюшка навскидку знала не менее дюжины."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b46478a-f87c-4b3b-99dc-d32dfe4376bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "a04f57a6-30d4-3213-bc84-2718dbc0a106",
                        "source_sense_description": "стрелять навскидку",
                        "target_lang_word": "toss one's gun up and shoot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "88974791-ff20-48e8-bc22-748dd3d70e04",
                        "source_entry_id": "a04f57a6-30d4-3213-bc84-2718dbc0a106",
                        "source_sense_description": "без подготовки, неточно",
                        "target_lang_word": "off the top of one's head",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "off the top of one's head",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ea82cfb-44d6-3050-be60-59c1b75534bb",
                                        "entry_id": "8110ee5f-668d-31fb-ad10-91d2cfe109c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an extemporaneous manner; without careful thought, preparation, or investigation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ba1bd0a-961b-4cc1-8ac5-00e49b997faa",
                                                "sense_id": "8ea82cfb-44d6-3050-be60-59c1b75534bb",
                                                "text": "I cannot think of any good examples off the top of my head, but give me a couple of hours and I'm sure I could come up with something."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "415b463f-d751-4d33-ba95-70ec8548bcc4",
                                                "sense_id": "8ea82cfb-44d6-3050-be60-59c1b75534bb",
                                                "text": "Ideally, one would wish to explore them through a series of depth interviews extending over several months, rather than by a brief survey interview, which necessarily tends to elicit responses off the top of one's head."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b894b1f-b9e8-49f2-ae70-e11e0a95ffe4",
                                                "sense_id": "8ea82cfb-44d6-3050-be60-59c1b75534bb",
                                                "text": "These responses are not analyzed but are intended to discourage answers off the top of one's head to the next question, which explicitly asks if these situated responses reflect the strength of character on focus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b5df5d1-2b45-49cc-8e43-0a79e21dba37",
                                                "sense_id": "8ea82cfb-44d6-3050-be60-59c1b75534bb",
                                                "text": "“Oh, I don't have my stuff with me, and I don't know her work phone number off the top of my head. Here, take one of my cards.” “Are you a lawyer, too?” he asked, and then perused her information."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "edc35cd4-b4fc-349a-a72a-1a54582cb033",
                                        "entry_id": "8110ee5f-668d-31fb-ad10-91d2cfe109c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see off, top, head."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77c5135e-7823-4b8a-b45c-d627e5296c81",
                        "source_entry_id": "a04f57a6-30d4-3213-bc84-2718dbc0a106",
                        "source_sense_description": "без подготовки, неточно",
                        "target_lang_word": "off the cuff",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "off the cuff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d03a478-5d4b-3929-8999-d32923e19afa",
                                        "entry_id": "ffb337c6-0baa-3584-9ab7-8b1651073a95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an off-the-cuff manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62079508-4cd0-4091-898a-a8b65c19231a",
                                                "sense_id": "6d03a478-5d4b-3929-8999-d32923e19afa",
                                                "text": "Nor was there anything off the cuff about their insistence that Manuel Pellegrini was happy to make the name of his replacement public knowledge, echoing his sentiment that they were “not doing anything behind me” from a press conference earlier in the same day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
